            "line": 381,
            "text": "theorem energyHistory_eq_logS (F : Profile) {XR : ℝ} (hXR : 0 < XR)\n    (c : ℝ → Coeff) {η : ℝ} (hη : η ∈ HeatedOutgoing.parameterDomain) (y : ℝ) :\n    energyHistory F XR c η (XR*Real.exp y) = XR*HeatSwitchCone.logS F XR c (y,η)"
